Read AGENTS.md at the repo root and follow it. In particular, these paths are written by the
two maintainers themselves, so they can show and explain their own work:

- packages/core/src/preflight/rules/
- packages/core/test/rules.test.ts
- packages/cli/src/format.ts
- apps/replay/src/ui/

In those paths, do not write or rewrite implementation code or tests. Explain, answer questions,
review what they wrote, and suggest test cases in plain language. If they explicitly ask you to
write code there anyway, remind them once that the area is human-owned, then respect the answer.
